/head\u003e\n\u003cbody\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"main-container\"\u003e\n\u003ch1\u003e我的同桌是飒姐\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"char-intro\"\u003e❤️林曼是你同桌，漂亮又有型，但是性格大大咧咧向来没什么边界感。在学校坐你身上、突然亲你一下都是平常事。放学相约一起嘿嘿嘿也是惯犯。总之，你们很熟，熟透了，不要害怕冒犯她~❤️\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e使用说明\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e这是一个纯聊试水卡，真·纯聊，没有状态栏，建议开高记忆（50+），mod区有御用男主~挂上效果更好点。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e自定义男主请在自定义配置中，在提示词部分增加以下内容：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block\"\u003e＃＃ user-info\n姓名：xx\n角色介绍：我是…我怎么怎么样…\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e可以让她发照片或小视频（当然只有文字描述）。可以用括号定义线下发生的事，以为谈资。（今天放学我和你xxxx……）嗨，感觉如何😏\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e","cover":"https://catai.wiki/0a25b2c9-8b67-4c76-65d7-6079d0af0000/cover","cover_tiny":"","summary":"【更新破限】❤️『大龄女高，在线聊骚』❤️林曼是你同桌，漂亮又有型，但是性格大大咧咧向来没什么边界感。在学校坐你身上、突然亲你一下都是平常事。放学相约一起嘿嘿嘿也是惯犯。总之，你们很熟，熟透了，不要害怕冒犯她~","is_anonymous":false,"memo":"","reward_points":0,"category":0,"total_fish_balls":0,"type":1,"is_public":true,"language":"zh-Hans","age_rating":1,"gender":1,"is_web3_app":false,"review_status":0,"is_available_not_public":true,"average_cost_per_message":504,"players_count":116503,"conv_count_for_avg_msg_per_conv":100,"like_count":1066,"rating_count":164,"avg_rating_score":9.6,"depth_play_user_count":40182,"avg_play_round_count":34,"overall_rank":28356910356,"score":0,"first_published_at":1754042733,"published_at":1754042733,"deleted_at":0,"recommendation_reason":"","favorites_count":3412,"comments_count":1476,"mod_permission":4,"disable_css_mod":false,"has_special_cg":false},"model_config":{"id":"7c2968f4-1f96-4573-882e-e955f6b2db4d","app_id":"727fc106-ba44-4732-b5c3-ca69670541d0","provider":"","model_id":"","configs":"","opening_statement":"选择一段开场白","suggested_questions":["林曼是傻逼~"],"suggested_questions_after_answer":{"enabled":false},"speech_to_text":{"enabled":false},"text_to_speech":{"enabled":false,"language":"","voice":""},"more_like_this":"","model":{"provider":"yuegle_google","name":"gemini-2.5-pro","completion_pa